    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior, ~9 yrs. Senior Design Engineer at Vercel (San Francisco, current; Design Engineer then Senior since July 2022). Rensselaer-trained computer scientist; before Vercel was an Artist and Game Developer at CPU Brew (2016-2019), which feeds his interactive, visually rich front-end work. Creative developer working in React, Next.js, Three.js and Framer Motion. His calling card is henryheffernan.com, a 90s-inspired 3D WebGL portfolio (a navigable room with a working CRT desktop OS) he designed, built and deployed himself (React + Three.js + AWS); widely referenced in the three.js community. Autonomy 4: senior IC who ships polished experiences end-to-end, but employed at Vercel rather than running independent client projects. Work Status Employed: LinkedIn, The Org and his own X posts agree he is currently at Vercel. Links: X @henryheffernan, GitHub henryjeff; no professional Instagram found. Judgment fields left at zero-state: Jonathan note is an observation (fun old-school Blender-built site), no relationship implied.",
